<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10207] Missed loss policy checks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10207</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In some cases (client reconnect, new client join, etc) PartitionLossPolicy may incorrectly validate operation. Return null for READ_ONLY_SAFE for loss partition.&lt;br/&gt;
To reproduce run CacheResultIsNotNullOnPartitionLossTest (1000 times) with random node stop.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
