                            <comment id="16686576" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 14 Nov 2018 14:27:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;, the change looks good to me. Please create a separate ticket to get rid of &lt;tt&gt;GridDhtForceKeysRequest&lt;/tt&gt; as we should never map read requests to nodes with &lt;tt&gt;MOVING&lt;/tt&gt; partitions (check if &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10251&quot; title=&quot;Get rid of the code left from times when lateAffinity=false was supported&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10251&quot;&gt;IGNITE-10251&lt;/a&gt; covers this case). We probably can also get rid of &lt;tt&gt;GridDhtGet*Future&lt;/tt&gt; which should give us some performance improvements.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
